"How much variance the points move around by" = "节点随机移动的幅度。";
"-1: Moves points without regard to concavity. 0: Avoids concave cells, but may create collinear faces. 0>: Additionally nudges towards the point." = "-1：移动时不考虑凹性；0：避免凹单元，但可能产生共线边；正值：额外向该点微调。";
