"Lower bound on the cost function for considering a change. (0.5 is a reasonable default given default weights)" = "考虑拓扑变更的代价函数下限。在默认权重下，0.5 是合理的默认值。";
"Toggle for merge operation consideration" = "是否考虑合并操作。";
